# Sibling projects living in this repo for convenience only. They have
# their own Dockerfile / docker-compose and ship as separate images;
# the chain image (Dockerfile.aposunpchain) MUST NOT pull these in.
# Listing them here keeps the chain build context lean and guarantees
# they never accidentally appear in the chain's runtime layers.
website/
Explorer/
ElyonStressBot/
elyon-bot/
